  "crew": [
    {
      "name": "Ben Nucci",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::a::vessel::7793e2e7-486c-11ee-a45f-fdfff6163a60::assets::c0d5c3f0-a2d3-11f1-8cbf-a1e32428b756/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Nationality: Canadian\nLanguages: English, French\n\nCaptain Ben grew up in Canada, surrounded by nature, and spent his summers exploring its beautiful lakes, where his passion for boating and adventure first began. Being on the water has always been a big part of his life—whether cruising, wakeboarding, tubing, or simply relaxing in the sun.\n\nSince then, his career has taken him to incredible places around the world. After a full season captaining crewed charters throughout the British and U.S. Virgin Islands, he developed an in-depth knowledge of the area and loves sharing its hidden gems, world-class snorkeling, vibrant beach bars, and breathtaking anchorages with guests.\n\nBeyond the Caribbean, he's captained private charters along the coastlines of Croatia and Sicily while building his offshore experience through yacht deliveries, with passages through the Baltic Sea, the U.K.'s coastal waters, Panama to Guadeloupe, and Jamaica to the Cayman Islands. These experiences have given him broad knowledge and confidence in both coastal cruising and offshore passagemaking.\n\nWhether guests are after adventure, relaxation, or a mix of both, Ben's goal is to create an unforgettable experience tailored to the group. He takes pride in a fun, welcoming atmosphere where everyone feels at home—great music, plenty of laughs, and a passion for showing guests the very best of the islands, making every charter a trip they'll remember long after stepping ashore.\n\nCertifications:\n\n• Yacht master \n• vhf radio\n• stcw\n• PBL 2"
    },
    {
      "name": "Katie Brown",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::a::vessel::7793e2e7-486c-11ee-a45f-fdfff6163a60::assets::d6ad0b20-a2d3-11f1-8cbf-a1e32428b756/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Nationality: British\nLanguages: English\n\nChef Katie hails from the UK and brings four seasons of yachting experience across the BVIs and Mediterranean to Sun Daze. A passionate and dedicated yacht chef, she thrives in the dynamic world of yacht hospitality, where attention to detail and creativity are paramount.\n\nKatie takes great pride in delivering exceptional cuisine, from elegant multi-course dinners to casual bites, and loves crafting high-quality cocktails to elevate every guest experience. Friendly, hardworking, and adaptable, she aims to create memorable dining moments that exceed expectations while maintaining a positive, professional atmosphere onboard.\n\nShe is excited to bring her culinary expertise, creativity, and enthusiasm to the team, ensuring every meal and every moment is enjoyable for guests and crew alike.\n\nOutside the galley, Katie loves sharing her favorite corners of the BVIs with guests, leading hikes to scenic overlooks, guiding them to secret snorkeling spots, and hosting boat-wide yoga sessions."
    }
  ],
